This appeal under Section 173(1) of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988 (hereinafter referred to as 'the Act',
for short) has been filed by the claimants being aggrieved by the judgment and award dated 06.08.2018 passed by the Motor Accident Claims Tribunal & I Additional Senior Civil Judge,
Mangaluru, D.K. (hereinafter referred to as 'the Tribunal') in MVC No.347/2018.
